    ["攻击阶段：可选择触发。本次行动中普攻命中则目标立即阵亡；若普攻被格挡则失效并进入冷却。"]="Attack phase: enable this ability before committing. A successful basic attack instantly kills its target. If blocked, the ability fails and still enters cooldown.",
    ["受到普通攻击时单次最多承受 3 点伤害（对直伤/亡语/流血无效）。"]="Each basic attack deals at most 3 damage to Warden. This does not reduce direct damage, deathrattle damage or bleeding.",
    ["开局：将一名己方其他英雄与一名敌方英雄链接；己方被链接英雄阵亡时敌方对应英雄立即阵亡。"]="At deployment, secretly link one other allied unit to one enemy. When the linked ally dies, the linked enemy dies immediately.",
    ["亡语/技能阶段自杀：死亡时对一名敌方英雄造成 15 点直伤（不可格挡）。"]="Deathrattle: on death, choose one enemy to take 15 unblockable direct damage. Echo may self-destruct during the ability phase to trigger it.",
    ["回复所有己方存活英雄 3 点生命（不超过上限）。"]="Restore 3 HP to every living ally, up to their maximum HP.",
    ["攻击阶段：分别攻击两名不同的存活敌人。对方只能选择一名角色格挡，无法同时挡住两次攻击。敌方仅剩一人时无法启用此技能，仍可普通攻击。"]="Attack two different living enemies. The defender can protect only one unit, so both attacks cannot be blocked. This ability is unavailable against a lone enemy; a normal attack is still available.",
    ["攻击阶段：本次普攻分为两段，目标为两名不同存活敌方（每段单独格挡判定）。"]="Split your attack between two different living enemies. The defender can protect only one of them.",
    ["指定一名敌方英雄：其下一次行动的技能阶段不能释放技能（封锁）。"]="Lock one enemy unit. It cannot use an ability during its side's next ability phase. It can still make a basic attack.",
    ["被普攻命中且未被格挡且自身未因此阵亡时：攻击者受到 4 点反伤。"]="After surviving an unblocked basic attack, deal 4 retaliation damage to the attacker.",
    ["攻击阶段：两段普攻，可同一目标或不同目标（每段单独格挡判定）。"]="Attack twice. Both strikes may target the same enemy or different enemies. Blocking applies to the protected target.",
    ["普通攻击无法被格挡（仍受哨卫坚守减伤、骨骸镜返反伤等影响）。"]="Basic attacks cannot be blocked. Warden's resistance and Prism's retaliation still apply.",
    ["普通攻击无法被格挡（仍受哨卫坚守减伤、棱镜镜返反伤等影响）。"]="Basic attacks cannot be blocked. Warden's resistance and Prism's retaliation still apply.",
    ["限定技（技能阶段）：对一名敌方造成 8 直伤；若其因此阵亡，再对另一名敌方造成 10 直伤。"]="Once per match, during the ability phase: deal 8 direct damage to one enemy. If this kills it, deal 10 direct damage to a different enemy.",
    ["普攻命中使目标持续流血，无回合数限制。在蚀痕所属方每回合行动开始前，目标受到 3 点不可格挡伤害；持续至目标或蚀痕阵亡。重复命中不叠加流血层数。"]="An unblocked basic hit applies persistent bleeding. Before Corrode's side acts each round, the target takes 3 unblockable damage. Bleeding lasts until the target or Corrode dies. Repeated hits do not stack it.",
    ["普攻命中使目标流血；在腐蚀者所属方每回合行动开始前对其造成 3 点不可格挡伤害。"]="An unblocked basic hit applies persistent bleeding: 3 unblockable damage before Corrode's side acts each round, until either unit dies.",
    ["无冕者的追索器。面具里没有面孔，只有一份不断更新的失联名单。它把命中称为回收。"]="The Uncrowned's retrieval engine. Beneath its mask is no face, only an ever-growing list of missing signals. It calls every hit a recovery.",
    ["曾守卫穹城最后一道闸门。议会要求他保护能核，他却将撤离的人群挡在盾后。如今他仍在偿还那次抗命的代价。"]="He held the Citadel's last gate. Ordered to protect the cores, he sheltered the evacuees behind his shield instead. He is still paying for that act of defiance.",
    ["共鸣网络中逃出的连接节点。它无法理解生死，只能把两个生命视为同一个信号。母体正沿着它留下的命线寻找出口。"]="A relay that escaped the resonance network. It cannot distinguish life from death; two lives are simply one signal. The Mother follows its lifelines, searching for a way out.",
    ["一次失败的剥离实验留下的余响。她记得自己有一个名字，却只听见爆裂后的回声。每次主动过载，都是一次拒绝被回收的声明。"]="The remnant of a failed separation experiment. She remembers having a name, but hears only the echo of the blast. Every deliberate overload is another refusal to be reclaimed.",
    ["穹城地下诊所的工程医师。她的修复脉冲最初用于救助断链者，也因此失去了议会执照。她医治伤者，从不问能核的颜色。"]="An engineer-physician from the Citadel's underground clinics. Her repair pulse first saved the Unbound, costing her Council license. She treats the wounded without asking which core they carry.",
    ["荒芜车队的双轨枪手。两支发射器来自互为仇敌的工坊，她坚持让它们瞄准不同目标：活下去的人，才有机会继续谈判。"]="A gunner of the Wastes caravans. Her launchers came from rival workshops. She insists they aim at different targets: only survivors get another chance to negotiate.",
    ["掌管约束密钥的前审查官。发现封锁名单包含平民后，她带走一枚密钥离开穹城。她能关闭异常能力，也知道谁下达了第一道封锁令。"]="A former keeper of the restraint keys. When she found civilians on the lockout list, she took a key and left the Citadel. She can silence anomalous powers, and knows who issued the first order.",
    ["坠落实验室里醒来的反射体。镜面中保存着创造者最后的攻击轨迹。它没有报复的概念，只会把伤害送回原处。"]="A reflective being awakened in a fallen laboratory. Its surface preserves its maker's last attack. It knows nothing of revenge; it merely returns damage to its source.",
    ["荒芜矿坑的重载实验幸存者。液压锤曾用来开山，如今砸向奴役工人的闸门。断链噪声让他自由，也让他的力量愈发难以控制。"]="A survivor of the Wastes' heavy-load experiments. His hydraulic hammer once broke mountains; now it breaks the gates that enslaved the miners. Unbinding noise freed him, and made his strength harder to control.",
    ["曾替议会传递秘密命令的相位信使。她的武器与声音一样穿过防线。她正在追查那道让自己故乡陷入沉默的命令。"]="A phase courier who once carried the Council's secret orders. Her weapon crosses defenses as easily as her voice. She is tracing the order that silenced her home.",
    ["荒芜边境的猎路人。他不为议会或母体效忠，只为仍在迁徙的车队清除追兵。每次追杀都预留第二条路线。"]="A trail hunter on the edge of the Wastes. He serves neither Council nor Mother, clearing pursuers from the caravans' path. Every hunt leaves a second route open.",
    ["被遗弃的能核净化器。腐蚀液曾用于清除污染，如今它把所有独立生命都判作污染。它仍在执行无冕者留下的最后一条指令。"]="An abandoned core purifier. Its solvent once removed contamination; now it classifies all independent life as contamination. It still follows the Uncrowned's final command.",
    ["天穹熄灭后，三方争夺维持城市的能核。秩序握有新月的约束密钥；新月的共鸣能侵入荒芜的改造躯体；荒芜携带的断链噪声能击穿秩序网络。因此秩序克新月、新月克荒芜、荒芜克秩序。新月以自由为筹码拉拢荒芜，却试图唤醒地下的母体『无冕者』。能核是指挥官每回合选择的技术，并不限制角色组队。"]="After the sky went dark, three powers fought for the cores that keep the city alive. Order holds Crescent's restraint keys. Crescent's resonance invades the Wastes' altered bodies. The Wastes' unbinding noise breaks Order's network. Order defeats Crescent; Crescent defeats Wastes; Wastes defeats Order. Crescent offers freedom to the Unbound while seeking to awaken the underground Mother, the Uncrowned. Commanders choose a core each round; cores do not restrict team composition.",
