    ["蛇形选取五名不同单位，保留角色各自的反制能力。"]="Draft five different units. Keep their strengths and counters in mind.",["蛇形选人：首选方先选 1 名，之后双方轮流选 2 名，最后另一方选 1 名。"]="Snake draft: the first side picks one unit, then sides alternate picking two. The other side takes the final pick.",["点选单位查看能力，再确认入队。双方各选五名，不可重复选择。"]="Inspect a unit, then confirm your pick. Each side drafts five units; no unit can be picked twice.",["观察对手已选阵容，准备你的下一手。"]="Read the opposing draft and prepare your next pick.",["先点单位查看能力，再确认入队。当前还可选 "]="Inspect a unit before confirming. Picks remaining: ",[" 名；双方不能重复选择同一单位。"]=". Units cannot be shared between teams.",
    ["选择一名己方其他单位，再选择敌方单位。己方目标阵亡时，敌方目标随之阵亡。只有你知道命线。"]="Choose one other ally, then one enemy. If the linked ally dies, the linked enemy dies too. Your lifeline remains secret.",["先选己方其他单位，再选敌方单位。己方绑定单位阵亡时，敌方绑定单位也会阵亡。"]="Choose one other ally, then one enemy. When the linked ally dies, the linked enemy also dies.",["命线触发条件是绑定单位阵亡；不是每次受伤。"]="Lifeline triggers when the linked ally dies, not whenever it takes damage.",["对手正在布置命线。它的目标尚未揭示。"]="Your opponent is setting a lifeline. Its targets are hidden.",["对手正在布置命线。敌方绑定目标不会向你揭示。"]="Your opponent is setting a secret lifeline. You cannot see its targets.",
    ["秩序 > 新月 > 荒芜 > 秩序。相同能核重新暗选。"]="Order > Crescent > Wastes > Order. Matching cores force a new secret choice.",["秩序克新月，新月克荒芜，荒芜克秩序。锁定前只能看到自己的选择。"]="Order defeats Crescent, Crescent defeats Wastes, and Wastes defeats Order. Both choices remain hidden until locked.",["箭头表示克制。相同能核重新暗选，后攻方仍有一次行动。"]="Arrows show which core wins. Matching cores are chosen again. The second side still gets one action.",["同核会重新暗选。后攻方仍有一次行动，先攻不等于多一次攻击。"]="Matching cores force a new choice. Initiative changes the order; it does not grant an extra attack.",["能核决定行动顺序。技能先于普攻结算；防守方只能让一名单位保护自己。仅剩一名单位时无法格挡。"]="Cores decide who acts first. Abilities resolve before basic attacks. The defender can protect one unit; a lone survivor cannot block.",
    ["技能与普攻分开：可先使用当前可用的技能，也可直接进入攻击阶段。"]="Abilities and basic attacks are separate decisions. Use an available ability first, or move straight to the attack phase.",["技能消耗冷却或限定次数。选中攻击目标后，等待对方暗选格挡。"]="Abilities use a cooldown or a once-per-match charge. Commit your attack, then wait for the defender's secret block.",["攻击技能有独立开关。普通攻击不会自动消耗攻击技能的冷却。"]="Attack abilities must be enabled explicitly. A normal attack does not use an attack ability's cooldown.",["可选择己方单位查看技能，也可直接进入攻击。技能效果会说明是否需要目标。"]="Inspect an ally's ability or proceed directly to attack. Ability descriptions explain their target requirements.",["对手在使用技能。先观察已经揭示的效果，再准备格挡。"]="Your opponent is using abilities. Observe the revealed effects and prepare to block.",["对手处于技能窗口。生命与冷却是已知信息。"]="Your opponent is in the ability phase. HP and cooldowns are public information.",
    ["选择进攻单位与目标；对手随后暗选格挡。"]="Choose your attacker and target. Your opponent then secretly chooses a unit to protect.",["先选己方进攻单位，再选敌方目标。承诺后，对手会暗选格挡，随后才揭示攻击。"]="Choose an allied attacker, then an enemy target. Commit your attack; it is revealed after the defender chooses a block.",["对手正在选择攻击；它的单位与目标尚未揭示。"]="Your opponent is choosing an attack. The attacker and target are still hidden.",["你的攻击已承诺。等待对手暗选格挡后一起揭示。"]="Attack committed. Both choices are revealed after your opponent locks a block.",["你已承诺进攻。等待对手选择格挡，随后揭示结算。"]="Attack committed. Wait for the block, then watch the resolution.",
    ["攻击已承诺，目标仍未知。让一名己方单位保护自己，或选择放弃格挡。"]="An attack is committed, but its target is hidden. Choose one ally to protect itself, or pass.",["敌方攻击已经承诺，目标仍未知。选择一名己方单位，让它保护自己。低语的攻击无法格挡。"]="The attack target is hidden. Choose one allied unit to protect itself. Whisper's attack cannot be blocked.",["格挡只保护所选单位；低语普攻无法格挡。防守方仅剩一名单位时，跳过格挡阶段。"]="A block protects only the selected unit. Whisper bypasses blocking. The block phase is skipped for a lone survivor.",["格挡不会替队友承伤。选择哪一名，就保护哪一名。"]="Blocking protects the selected unit only. It does not redirect damage from a teammate.",
    ["残影已经阵亡，但亡语尚未结算。选择一名存活敌方单位，造成 15 点不可格挡直伤。"]="Echo is dead, but its deathrattle is pending. Choose a living enemy to take 15 unblockable direct damage.",["残影的亡语正在选目标。剩余结算会在选择后继续。"]="Echo's deathrattle needs a target. The remaining resolution continues after the choice.",["对手正在选择亡语目标。选择后会继续尚未结束的结算。"]="Your opponent is choosing a deathrattle target. The remaining resolution follows.",["亡语不可格挡。剩余攻击、命线与连锁结算仍会继续，直到队列处理完毕。"]="Deathrattles cannot be blocked. Remaining attacks, lifelines and death chains continue until every pending effect resolves.",
    ["被动能力会自动触发。"]="Passive abilities trigger automatically.",["被动能力自动触发，无需手动释放。"]="This passive triggers automatically. No manual activation is needed.",["该单位的技能窗口被封锁；普通攻击仍可选择它。"]="This unit's ability is locked. It may still make a basic attack.",["该技能在攻击阶段启用。先进入攻击，再选择是否使用。"]="Enable this ability during the attack phase, before committing.",["该能力在攻击阶段启用。"]="This ability is enabled during the attack phase.",["技能窗口被封锁，仍可进入攻击。"]="Abilities are locked. You can still proceed to attack.",["技能生效后继续进入攻击阶段。"]="Resolve the ability, then proceed to attack.",["看清技能的触发阶段、冷却或限定次数，再决定是否使用。"]="Check the ability's phase, cooldown and charges before using it.",
    ["当前为普通攻击；技能尚未启用。"]="Normal attack selected. Attack ability is off.",["裂轨射击需要两个不同目标。"]="Split Rail requires two different targets.",["双轨攻击两名不同敌人，对方只能保护其中一名。仅剩一名敌人时不能启用。"]="Twinrail attacks two different enemies. Only one can be protected. Split Rail is unavailable against a lone enemy.",["敌方只剩一名单位，裂轨射击需要两个不同目标；本次使用普攻。"]="Only one enemy remains. Split Rail needs two targets; use a normal attack instead.",["重锤可双击同一目标：再次点①即可标为①②；也可选另一个目标。"]="Maul can strike the same target twice: select target ① again for ①②, or select a different enemy.",["先选①目标，再选不同的②目标。①被击杀后才会续算②；仅剩一个敌人时不需②。"]="Choose target ①, then a different target ②. The second strike happens only if the first kills. No second target is needed against a lone enemy.",["点击第二目标；再次点击同一目标可连击。"]="Choose a second target, or select the same target again to strike it twice.",
    ["限定技本局已经用完。"]="This ability has already been used this match.",["限定技已耗尽"]="No charges left",["限定技已使用"]="Used this match",["的限定技已耗尽，本局不能再次使用。"]=" has no charges left this match.",["技能冷却剩余 "]="Ability ready in ",["还需冷却 "]="Ready in ",[" 回合；每完整回合结束后递减。"]=" rounds; reduced after each complete round.",[" 回合。"]=" rounds.",["代价：技能攻击后冷却 "]="After the attack: cooldown ",["代价：使用后冷却 "]="Cooldown after use: ",["代价：限定技本局只能使用一次。"]="Once per match.",["代价：残影立即阵亡，再手动选择亡语目标。"]="Echo dies immediately. Then choose a deathrattle target.",["自毁会让残影立即阵亡并触发亡语；这不是普通伤害技能。"]="Self-destruct kills Echo immediately and triggers its deathrattle.",["无需敌方目标：恢复所有己方存活单位。"]="No enemy target required. Heal every living ally.",["无需敌方目标：自毁后再选择亡语目标。"]="No target needed yet. Self-destruct, then choose the deathrattle target.",["先选择技能目标；双目标技能还需选择②。"]="Choose the ability target. Two-target abilities also need target ②.",
    ["轮到你 · 暗选能核"]="Your turn · Choose a core",["轮到你 · 选择"]="Your turn · Choose ",["轮到你"]="Your turn",["等待对手…"]="Waiting for opponent…",["等待对手"]="Waiting for opponent",["对手行动"]="Opponent's action",["己方行动"]="Your action",["争夺先攻"]="Seize initiative",["建立阵容"]="Draft your team",["选人"]="Draft",["技能窗口"]="Ability phase",["进攻"]="Attack",["防守"]="Defense",["承诺进攻"]="Commit attack",["进入攻击阶段"]="Attack phase",["跳过技能 · 进入攻击"]="Skip ability · Attack",["锁定能核"]="Lock core",["设置命线"]="Set lifeline",["绑定命线"]="Bind lifeline",["确认格挡"]="Lock block",["放弃格挡"]="Pass block",["确认入队"]="Confirm pick",["释放亡语"]="Resolve deathrattle",["自毁 · 终响"]="Self-destruct",["释放 "]="Use ",["释放"]="Use ",
    ["选择一种能核"]="Choose a core",["选择进攻单位"]="Choose attacker",["选择攻击目标"]="Choose attack target",["选择①目标"]="Choose target ①",["选择②目标"]="Choose target ②",["选择第二目标"]="Choose second target",["选择亡语目标"]="Choose deathrattle target",["选择己方单位，查看技能"]="Inspect an allied ability",["选择己方单位（不能是缚命）"]="Choose an ally other than Tether",["选择敌方绑定目标"]="Choose the linked enemy",["选择一名己方格挡单位"]="Choose an ally to protect",["选择要保护的己方单位。"]="Choose the allied unit to protect.",["先选进攻单位"]="Choose an attacker first",["先选格挡单位"]="Choose a blocking unit first",["先选一名单位"]="Choose a unit first",["先选择"]="Choose ",["目标已选择"]="Target selected",["目标："]="Target: ",["目标"]="Target",["无需目标"]="No target",["已启用"]="Enabled",["未启用"]="Off",["已耗尽"]="Used",["未选择"]="Not selected",["被封锁"]=" Locked",[" 已封锁"]=" Locked",["已锁定，等待揭示"]="Locked · Waiting for reveal",["已锁定 · 等待揭示"]="Locked · Waiting for reveal",["锁定后等待双方揭示"]="Lock your choice, then reveal together",
    ["己方已入队 "]="Your picks ",["己方已选"]="Your draft",["对手已选"]="Opponent's draft",["对手正在选人。观察它的阵容，准备下一次选择。"]="Your opponent is drafting. Read their team and prepare your next pick.",["对手正在行动。留意生命和冷却变化。"]="Your opponent is acting. Watch HP and cooldowns.",["等待对手结束行动。"]="Wait for your opponent to finish.",["未知"]="Unknown",["未揭示"]="Hidden",["尚未揭示"]="Hidden",["已揭示"]="Revealed",["观察对手"]="Read the opponent",["记住这一点"]="Remember this",["看清"]="Inspect",
    ["训练完成"]="Training complete",["训练 "]="Training ",["战术指导  "]="Battle guide  ",["练习技能"]="Practice an ability",["恢复哨卫"]="Heal Warden",["保护支援单位"]="Protect your support",["查看一名单位的能力"]="Inspect a unit's ability",["再试一次"]="Try again",["这一步先选择"]="For this step, choose ",["这一步需要先选择复苏，释放修复脉冲。"]="Choose Mender, then use Repair Pulse.",["先观察角色用途。复苏负责恢复，是这次教学场景要保护的支援单位。"]="Inspect the units first. Mender heals your team and is the support to protect in this lesson.",["教学对手倾向攻击支援单位。复苏负责恢复；点选它，再确认格挡。哨卫已在前一回合受伤，稍后将练习恢复。"]="The training opponent favors attacking your support. Select Mender and lock the block. Warden was wounded last round; you will heal him next.",["格挡只保护你选中的那名单位，不会替队友承伤。观察教学提示，再试一次。"]="A block protects only the selected unit. It does not take a teammate's damage. Read the hint and try again.",["你让复苏保护自己，正好挡住了双轨的攻击。接下来练习恢复受伤的哨卫。"]="Mender protected herself and blocked Twinrail's attack. Next, heal the wounded Warden.",["格挡成功不造成伤害。接下来恢复前一回合受伤的哨卫。"]="A successful block prevents damage. Next, heal Warden's wound from the previous round.",["哨卫现在为 23 / 26 生命。选择复苏，再释放修复脉冲，恢复所有受伤的己方单位。使用技能后仍有一次普攻。"]="Warden has 23 / 26 HP. Select Mender and use Repair Pulse to heal wounded allies. You still get a basic attack afterward.",["释放后进入冷却，但不会消耗普攻机会。选择复苏，观察哨卫的生命恢复。"]="Using an ability starts its cooldown but does not spend your basic attack. Choose Mender and watch Warden recover.",["选择复苏，恢复己方受伤单位，无需敌方目标。"]="Choose Mender to heal wounded allies. No enemy target is needed.",["哨卫已恢复至 26 / 26，复苏进入 3 回合冷却。进入攻击阶段，选择进攻单位和目标。可试选夺魄，再启用掠魂；不启用则是普通攻击。教学对手会格挡荒行，选择其他目标观察命中。"]="Warden is back to 26 / 26 HP; Mender starts a 3-round cooldown. Choose an attacker and target. Try Reaper with Soul Reap enabled, or leave it off for a normal attack. The training opponent will protect Outrider.",["选择进攻单位与目标。可启用掠魂；普通攻击不会自动使用技能。教学对手会格挡荒行。"]="Choose an attacker and target. Soul Reap must be enabled separately. The training opponent will block Outrider.",["先进入攻击阶段，再选择进攻单位。攻击技能需要独立启用；普攻不会自动消耗它。"]="Enter the attack phase, then choose your attacker. Attack abilities must be enabled separately.",["你保护了复苏、用技能恢复了哨卫，并完成进攻承诺。技能窗口与普攻是两次不同的决策；攻击技能还要独立启用。正式对局不公开对手意图，训练不计比赛战绩。"]="You protected Mender, healed Warden and committed an attack. Abilities and basic attacks are separate decisions. Attack abilities must also be enabled explicitly. In a real match, the opponent's intent stays hidden.",["正式对手不会公开它准备攻击谁。训练提示不会出现在正式对局中。"]="Outside training, your opponent's intended target stays hidden.",["，练习恢复技能。"]=" to practice healing.",["消灭对方全部单位"]="Eliminate every opposing unit",["让对手先露出破绽"]="Make your opponent reveal an opening",
